"║┌Highlights──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐║"
"║│  [Changed] **maestro is now a cargo workspace of three crates.** `maestro-core` holds sessions, config, costs, adapt, insight and the rest of the engine; `maestro-tui` holds t│║"
"║│  [Changed] **The core no longer depends on the terminal UI.** `maestro-core` has no `ratatui` or `crossterm` dependency; theme colors use a core-owned `ThemeColor`, converted │║"
"║│  [Changed] **CI runs the tests on four parallel nextest shards**, plus a separate doctest job, behind the same required `Test` check. Wall time is about the same as before (~2│║"
"║│  [Changed] **Lint, tests and gates cover every crate.** clippy, nextest, doctests, coverage and the local gates (`/implement`, preflight, release) run with `--workspace`. (#13│║"
"║│                                                                                                                                                                                │║"
